1
00:00:00,198 --> 00:00:02,508
(Howard:)One roll of toilet paper
and 20 minutes later,

2
00:00:02,668 --> 00:00:05,008
(Howard:)I was so humiliated,

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,880
(Howard:)I snuck out the window
and never saw her again.

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,520
(Emily:)You know what else

5
00:00:09,675 --> 00:00:11,715
(Emily:)my security deposit.

6
00:00:11,877 --> 00:00:13,447
(Howard:)I'm sorry.

7
00:00:13,612 --> 00:00:16,562
(Howard:)I tried to unclog it,
but you didn't have a plunger,

8
00:00:16,715 --> 00:00:18,215
(Howard:)and water was
spilling out everywhere.

9
00:00:18,383 --> 00:00:20,023
(Emily:)Right, just water.

10
00:00:22,154 --> 00:00:24,394
(Howard:)Look, I have felt terrible
about this for years,

11
00:00:24,556 --> 00:00:28,566
(Howard:)and I'm glad I have the opportunity
to tell you just how sorry I am.

12
00:00:28,727 --> 00:00:30,727
(Emily:)It's fine.

13
00:00:30,896 --> 00:00:32,396
(Emily:)All my friends love this story.

14
00:00:32,564 --> 00:00:34,704
(Emily:)They call you Clogzilla.

15
00:00:35,734 --> 00:00:38,214
(Raj:)Get it? Because you
clogged up her bathroom

16
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,980
(Raj:)like a radioactive monster!

17
00:00:41,073 --> 00:00:43,523
(Howard:)-Yeah, yeah, I get it.
-Howie.

18
00:00:43,675 --> 00:00:46,245
(Howard:)Well, hey, it's not like
cotton candy comes out of you.

19
00:00:49,147 --> 00:00:51,427
(Amy:)Come on, let's get you to bed.
You've had a lot to drink.

20
00:00:51,583 --> 00:00:53,033
(Sheldon:)No more than Penny.

21
00:00:53,185 --> 00:00:55,065
(Amy:)That's what I'm saying.

22
00:00:55,187 --> 00:00:58,397
(Sheldon:)Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait...

